[{"title":"Automation Engineer - MBI","company":"Burns & McDonnell","location":"Mumbai","date_posted":"2026-09-23","url":"https://www.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=68b198d6bbd851fc&from=serp&vjs=3","source":"indeed","experience":"5 Yrs","skills":[103],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Description**\n\n\n**Automation Engineer**\n\n\n**Job Description**\n\n\nWe are seeking a skilled Automation Engineer to join our team. In this role, the engineer will design, develop, and deliver automation systems and related engineering packages while collaborating with cross\\-functional teams to meet project requirements, client expectations, and quality standards.\n\n\nThe role may include full or partial responsibility for the following assignments:\n\n\n* Understand project scope and execute engineering activities in line with project requirements.\n\n\n* Prepare engineering and project budget estimates, schedules, and related planning inputs.\n\n\n* Execute substation and industrial automation design, including network architectures, I/O and signal lists, schematic drawings, wiring diagrams, panel layouts, fiber\\-based networks, control building arrangements, raceway layouts, and auxiliary AC/DC power systems.\n\n\n* Prepare bills of materials and bills of quantities for equipment and project specifications.\n\n\n* Coordinate design activities with other departments and project stakeholders as required.\n\n\n* Perform quality reviews of engineering deliverables to ensure accuracy, completeness, and compliance with project standards.\n\n\n* Develop configurations and settings for network switches, data concentrators, RTUs, SCADA systems, PLCs, and related automation equipment.\n\n\n**Qualifications**\n\n\n**Qualifications**\n\n\n* Bachelor’s degree in Electrical, Electronics, Telecommunications, or Instrumentation Engineering.\n\n\n* 3\\-5 years of experience in the design, configuration, and testing of substation automation systems or PLC\\-based projects.\n\n\n* Familiarity with standard engineering techniques, procedures, and best practices, with the ability to apply them in project execution.\n\n\n* Familiarity with communication protocols such as Modbus, DNP3, and IEC 61850, along with applicable IEEE standards, and the ability to apply them in project execution.\n\n\n* Experience working with industrial automation projects is preferred.\n\n\n* Experience working with software tools such as SEL AcSELerator RTAC, SEL\\-5030 AcSELerator QuickSet, SEL Architect, and Diagram Builder is an added advantage.\n\n\n* Excellent written and verbal communication skills.\n\n\n* Experience with HMI platforms such as AVEVA System Platform or SEL or COPA\\-DATA zenon is an added advantage.\n\n\n* Experience working with U.S. utility clients is preferred.\n\n\n* Strong attention to detail, with effective facilitation, team\\-building, collaboration, organization, and problem\\-solving skills.\n\n\nThis job posting will remain open a minimum of 72 hours and on an ongoing basis until filled.\n\n\n**Job** Engineering\n\n\n**Primary Location** India\\-Maharashtra\\-Mumbai\n\n\n**Schedule:** Full\\-time\n\n\n**Travel:** No\n\n\n**Req ID:** 264669\n\n\n**Job Hire Type** Experienced Not Applicable \\#BMI N/A","indeed_jk":"68b198d6bbd851fc","permanent_url":"https://www.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=68b198d6bbd851fc&from=serp&vjs=3"},{"title":"AI Automation Engineer","company":"Connectix-x Technology Solution","location":"Mumbai","date_posted":"2026-07-07","url":"https://www.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=99ca5e98f7e5d2d3&from=serp&vjs=3","experience":"3 Yrs","skills":[1,3,12,17,20,34,35],"indeed_jk":"99ca5e98f7e5d2d3","permanent_url":"https://www.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=99ca5e98f7e5d2d3&from=serp&vjs=3"},{"title":"Senior Automation Engineer","company":"Siemens","location":"Mumbai","date_posted":"2026-07-07","url":"https://www.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=e155c29f36d0327e&from=serp&vjs=3","experience":"8 Yrs","skills":[103,105],"indeed_jk":"e155c29f36d0327e","permanent_url":"https://www.ind